* Generic small-signal silicon switching diode model
* Authored for Omnia under CC0-1.0 (SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0)
* Standard silicon junction parameters (forward drop ~0.68 V at 10 mA)
.model DIODE_SIGNAL D(
+ IS=2.52e-9 N=1.752 RS=0.568 CJO=4e-12 VJ=0.7 M=0.333
+ TT=20e-9 BV=100 IBV=1e-4)
